# go.ymotongpoo.com: vanity import paths for Go modules, plus the pbt guide.
# Rules apply in order, the first match wins, and they take precedence over
# static assets, so the guide's rules come before the catch-all for /pbt.
# The guide's files live under /guide/pbt and are served at /pbt/guide.
/pbt/guide        /pbt/guide/               301
/pbt/guide/       /guide/pbt/index.html     200
/pbt/guide/ja     /pbt/guide/ja/            301
/pbt/guide/ja/    /guide/pbt/ja/index.html  200
/pbt/guide/*      /guide/pbt/:splat         200
# Every other path under /pbt returns the same page so that `go get` can
# resolve go.ymotongpoo.com/pbt and all of its subpackages (e.g. /pbt/fsm).
/pbt              /pbt/index.html           200
/pbt/*            /pbt/index.html           200
